msgid "vo_sm_char11_m03_stg18_03"
msgstr "Pilot: Hey there, ground forces, this is Eagle One."

msgid "vo_sm_char11_m03_stg18_03_01"
msgstr ""
"Pilot: We're swooping into town now, got a whole mess of tanks in our "
"sights."

msgid "vo_sm_char11_m03_stg18_03_02"
msgstr ""
"Pilot: And we're ready to rain down some packages. Make yourselves scarce "
"down there."

msgid "vo_sm_char11_m03_stg18_03_03"
msgstr "Pilot: Eagle One out."

msgid "vo_sm_char11_m03_stg22_01"
msgstr "Pilot: This is Eagle One, loud and clear."

msgid "vo_sm_char11_m03_stg22_01_01"
msgstr "Pilot: You've got a small cluster of targets huddled in the square."

msgid "vo_sm_char11_m03_stg22_01_02"
msgstr "Pilot: We're lining up for a pass now."

msgid "vo_sm_char11_m03_stg22_01_03"
msgstr ""
"Pilot: Whatever we don't turn into fireworks, it's all yours. Happy hunting!"
" Over."

msgid "vo_sm_char11_m03_stg23_02"
msgstr ""
"Pilot: Where'd they come from? I was sure our air support had cleared the "
"skies."

msgid "vo_sm_char11_m03_stg28_01"
msgstr "Pilot: This is Eagle One, over."

msgid "vo_sm_char11_m03_stg28_01_01"
msgstr ""
"Pilot: You've got a hefty group of armored vehicles rolling your way from "
"the village."

msgid "vo_sm_char11_m03_stg28_05"
msgstr "Pilot: We'll make a pass and... Damn!"

msgid "vo_sm_char11_m03_stg28_05_01"
msgstr "Pilot: Fighters at 8 o'clock… Can't shake this guy off my tail."

msgid "vo_sm_char11_m03_stg28_05_02"
msgstr "Pilot: Where's our escort, damn it! A-a-ahh!"

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg07_02"
msgstr "Pilot: Storm Petrel here."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg07_04"
msgstr "Pilot: Copy that. King Tiger's about to have a bad day."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg08_01"
msgstr "Pilot: Blast it!"

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg12_01"
msgstr "Pilot: Enemy destroyed."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg12_02"
msgstr "Pilot: Storm Petrel. Not Seagull."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg21_01"
msgstr "Pilot: I see it."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg21_01_01"
msgstr "Pilot: Target destroyed in 3...2...1..."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg22_01"
msgstr "Pilot: Standing by for new targets, Betsy."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg24_02"
msgstr "Pilot: Damn!"

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg24_04"
msgstr ""
"Pilot: It's not just a Jagdtiger down there. They're holed up in buildings."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg24_04_01"
msgstr ""
"Pilot: We need something with more punch. Time to call in something bigger!"

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg30_01"
msgstr "Pilot: That's a wrap! Ready for the next one!"

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg32_02"
msgstr "Pilot: Ready to attack on your signal."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg41_02"
msgstr "Pilot: Direct hit!"

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg45_02"
msgstr "Pilot: Copy that! Engaging!"

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg46_02"
msgstr "Pilot: Finally! Heading back to the airfield. See you soon, chaps!"

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg48_01"
msgstr "Pilot: Ready and waiting for the target."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg48_02"
msgstr "Pilot: Awaiting target confirmation."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg48_03"
msgstr "Pilot: Coordinates required for targeting strike."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg49_01"
msgstr "Pilot: Can't hit it until you immobilize it."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg49_02"
msgstr "Pilot: Need that target stationary for an accurate strike."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg49_03"
msgstr "Pilot: Immobility is key to a successful hit!"

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg50_01"
msgstr "Pilot: Making a turn, I'll be back shortly."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg50_02"
msgstr "Pilot: Repositioning, back in action shortly."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg51_01"
msgstr "Pilot: Ready for the attack."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg51_02"
msgstr "Pilot: Signal when to strike."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg52_01"
msgstr "Pilot: Still on standby here."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg52_02"
msgstr "Pilot: Continuing to wait for instructions."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg53_02"
msgstr "Pilot: Copy that. Lining up for the attack now."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg54_02"
msgstr "Pilot: Received. Moving in for the strike."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg55_02"
msgstr "Pilot: Roger that. Engaging the target."

msgid "vo_sm_char12_m04_stg56_02"
msgstr "Pilot: Acknowledged. Approaching for the hit."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_outro_04"
msgstr "Smith: Not the paper itself."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_outro_06"
msgstr ""
"Smith: The will of millions. Men and women who fought to make that paper "
"mean something."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_outro_07"
msgstr "Smith: Never again."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg01_01"
msgstr "Commander, Capt. Smith: Roll out. Remember, this is a covert op."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg01_01_01"
msgstr ""
"Smith: Avoid unnecessary engagements and fire only when absolutely "
"necessary."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg01_02"
msgstr ""
"Smith: If we alert the entire garrison, our chances will be slim to none."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg01_02_01"
msgstr "Smith: Whenever possible, we find a detour and hide."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg01_03"
msgstr "Smith: No time to waste. Move out. Every second counts."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg02_06"
msgstr "Smith: Drop it. We're all here to stop a slaughter. Both sides."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg02_07"
msgstr "Smith: STOP! Reverse!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg02_08"
msgstr "Smith: Back up!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg03_01"
msgstr "Smith: Back up! Faster!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg03_02"
msgstr "Smith: Reverse, now!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg03_03"
msgstr "Smith: Hide!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg03_04"
msgstr "Smith: Looks like they didn't spot us properly."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg03_04_01"
msgstr ""
"Smith: The darkness works in our favor—takes them longer to identify an "
"American tank."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg03_05"
msgstr "Smith: If we get through quickly, they won't identify us."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg03_05_01"
msgstr "Smith: Murphy, get us behind that corner."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg03_06"
msgstr "Smith: Good, Murphy. We need to inch closer. And don't shoot!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg03_07"
msgstr "Smith: Let's sneak even closer. There!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg03_08"
msgstr "Smith: Move fast and they won't spot us."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg03_09"
msgstr "Smith: The faster we go, the less time they have to notice us."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg03_10"
msgstr ""
"Smith: If we move quickly, they won't have time to get a good look at us."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg04_01"
msgstr "Smith: Need to scout ahead. Dubois, check the situation."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg04_06"
msgstr "Smith: I said drop it, Kowalski."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg04_07"
msgstr "Smith: They're moving out. Dubois, get back in."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg04_09"
msgstr "Smith: Let's get these maps. Move out."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg05_01"
msgstr "Smith: Damn! Enemy at 12 o'clock. Kowalski, fire!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg05_02"
msgstr "Smith: Murphy, evasive maneuvers. Kowalski, finish him quick."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg05_02_01"
msgstr ""
"Smith: We don't have time to mess around. Need to keep the noise down."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg05_06"
msgstr ""
"Smith: Enough, Kowalski. We won't get through to our boys without Keller."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg05_06_01"
msgstr "Smith: Let's move before someone else shows up."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg06_01"
msgstr "Smith: Tiger! Get to cover! Damn."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg06_03"
msgstr "Smith: Negative. Can't risk it. Keller. Try to distract him."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg06_04"
msgstr "Smith: Keller, c'mon. Do it."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg06_05"
msgstr "Smith: Use the radio to trick them."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg06_13"
msgstr "Smith: Move out before he comes back."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg08_01"
msgstr "Smith: Dubois, find that map."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg08_04"
msgstr "Smith: What is it?"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg08_07"
msgstr "Smith: So we're collecting map pieces. Let's move."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg09_02"
msgstr "Smith: Excellent. Murphy, mark it down."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg09_09"
msgstr "Smith: Let's move to the next point. Time's running short."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg10_03"
msgstr "Smith: Let's move to the next post."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg11_04"
msgstr "Smith: Let's move on. Every minute counts."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg11_05"
msgstr "Smith: Dubois, check for the map."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg12_02"
msgstr "Smith: Murphy, what's our progress?"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg13_04"
msgstr "Smith: At least we know about other command posts now. Move out."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg14_01"
msgstr "Smith: Dubois? Found anything?"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg14_05"
msgstr "Smith: Move to the next point. Time's running short."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg15_01"
msgstr "Smith: Dubois, you're up."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg15_08"
msgstr "Smith: Let's move to the next position."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg16_01"
msgstr "Smith: Murphy, what's our progress?"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg17_04"
msgstr "Smith: Let's see what we find."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg18_01"
msgstr "Smith: Keller, is this a command post?"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg20_01"
msgstr "Smith: Fall back!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg20_02"
msgstr "Smith: Do not engage!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg20_03"
msgstr "Smith: Don't fire!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg20_04"
msgstr "Smith: Don't fire! That's not why we're here!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg20_05"
msgstr ""
"Smith: Easy now! Our job is to deliver a message, not start a bloodbath!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg20_06"
msgstr "Smith: Back up now! They'll spot us!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg20_07"
msgstr "Smith: Retreat! Don't let them see us!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg20_08"
msgstr "Smith: Reverse, Murphy! Keep us hidden!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg21_01"
msgstr "Smith: Undetected. Keep it that way."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg21_02"
msgstr "Smith: Enemy's blind to us."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg22_01"
msgstr "Smith: Back up, now! They've almost spotted us!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg22_02"
msgstr "Smith: Fall back! They're about to spot us!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg22_03"
msgstr "Smith: Murphy, find us cover! They don't realize who we are yet!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg22_04"
msgstr "Smith: Move it! They're still unsure!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg22_05"
msgstr "Smith: Get in those shadows! They didn't recognize us!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg22_06"
msgstr "Smith: Murphy, turn around! Or they figure it out!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg23_01"
msgstr "Smith: I think we should pull back."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg23_02"
msgstr "Smith: We can't risk the mission. Let's withdraw."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg23_03"
msgstr "Smith: Remember our mission! If retreat is safer, that's what we do."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg24_01"
msgstr "Smith: Change position. They'll sweep this area."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg24_02"
msgstr "Smith: Move it. This place will be crawling with Panzers soon."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg25_01"
msgstr "Smith: They missed us. Stay low and quiet."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg26_01"
msgstr "Smith: Engage targets!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg26_02"
msgstr "Smith: Battle stations! Stay focused!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg26_03"
msgstr "Smith: Contact!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg27_01"
msgstr "Smith: Clear! Move out!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg28_01"
msgstr "Smith: Target down!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg28_02"
msgstr "Smith: Destroyed!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg29_01"
msgstr "Smith: Tough bastard. Next time, let's find another option."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg30_01"
msgstr "Smith: Better scout ahead before moving in."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg34_01"
msgstr "Smith: Back in the tank. Let's move."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg34_02"
msgstr "Smith: Enough scouting. Get going."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg34_03"
msgstr "Smith: Everyone mount up. Time to roll."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg34_04"
msgstr "Smith: Let's not waste time. Move out."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg35_01"
msgstr "Smith: Keller can draw them away with a false order."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg42_01"
msgstr ""
"Smith: Focus on the objective. We need those map fragments to save our men."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg43_01"
msgstr "Smith: Move it! This isn't nap time."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg43_02"
msgstr "Smith: Every second counts. Get moving."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg44_01"
msgstr "Smith: No choice. We'll have to fight."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg45_01"
msgstr "Smith: Find us an alternate route."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg46_01"
msgstr "Smith: Use the radio. Lead them away from us."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg47_01"
msgstr "Smith: Wait for their patrol to move."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg48_01"
msgstr "Smith: Tank's fixed, but we lost a lot of time. Stay sharp."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg50_01"
msgstr ""
"Smith: They're on high alert. Now they'll shoot as soon as they see us."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg53_01"
msgstr "Smith: Where did they come from?"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg54_01"
msgstr "Smith: We're cutting it too close. Push forward!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg55_06"
msgstr "Smith: Murphy, just get us there in one piece."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg57_01"
msgstr "Smith: Tiger! Damn!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg57_03"
msgstr "Smith: He's hunting us."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg57_03_01"
msgstr ""
"Smith: Can't penetrate his front armor, but he'll tear through ours like "
"paper."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg57_03_02"
msgstr "Smith: Just keep moving—speed is our only advantage!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg58_01"
msgstr "Smith: Enemy artillery's waking up. We'll need to maneuver!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg58_03"
msgstr "Smith: Just do what you can."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg59_01"
msgstr "Smith: Tiger is close. Keep the distance, Murphy!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg59_02"
msgstr "Smith: Tiger is too close! We need to break away!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg60_01"
msgstr "Smith: Pull away now! He's got us in his sights!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg60_02"
msgstr "Smith: He's got us zeroed! Evade now!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg61_01"
msgstr "Smith: Tiger missed! Don't give him another chance!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg63_01"
msgstr "Smith: Save the ammo. It's no use firing at a Tiger's frontal armor."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg63_02"
msgstr "Smith: Forget the Tiger—focus on smaller targets."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg64_01"
msgstr "Smith: Track's blown! He's immobilized!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg65_01"
msgstr "Smith: Artillery! Hard right!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg65_02"
msgstr "Smith: Artillery strike! Break left!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg65_03"
msgstr "Smith: Incoming! Full stop!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg65_04"
msgstr "Smith: Arty! Evasive maneuvers!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg65_05"
msgstr "Smith: Artillery barrage! Turn now!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg66_01"
msgstr "Smith: These we can handle. Kowalski, weapons free."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg66_02"
msgstr "Smith: These can be destroyed. Kowalski, engage at will."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg67_01"
msgstr "Smith: Don't waste ammo on the Ferdinand!"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg67_02"
msgstr "Smith: Ignore the Ferdinand—we can't hurt it."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg70_01"
msgstr "Smith: Minefield behind us. Murphy, floor it. Our boys are waiting."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg70_03"
msgstr "Smith: Keller, switch to Allied frequency, patch me through."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg70_05"
msgstr ""
"Smith: Attention all units, this is Captain Jack Smith, 2nd Armored "
"Division."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg70_05_01"
msgstr "Smith: We are approaching in M24 Chaffee from the west."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg70_05_02"
msgstr "Smith: Hold your fire. I repeat, hold your fire."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg70_05_03"
msgstr ""
"Smith: We have urgent orders from III Corps HQ. Challenge: ''Torch''. Over."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg70_06"
msgstr "Smith: We're home, boys. This war's done here."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg71_01"
msgstr "Smith: God damn it. We failed them all."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg72_01"
msgstr ""
"Smith: Too much noise. We're lighting up every radar from here to Berlin."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg72_02"
msgstr "Smith: This isn't a shooting gallery. We need to be more stealthy."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg72_03"
msgstr ""
"Smith: We need to move quieter. Every shot brings more unwanted attention."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg72_04"
msgstr ""
"Smith: All this noise will bring reinforcements. We won't make it to our "
"boys in time."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg81_02"
msgstr "Smith: Did you catch anything?"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg81_04"
msgstr "Smith: A good one?"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg82_02"
msgstr "Smith: No."

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg84_02"
msgstr "Smith: A street? How? By listing all our names?"

msgid "vo_sm_char13_m06_stg84_04"
msgstr "Smith: Focus on the road."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_outro_08"
msgstr "Keller: Nie wieder."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg02_03"
msgstr ""
"Radio operator, Gefr. Keller: There's a... command post just outside of "
"town. They keep minefield maps there."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg04_04"
msgstr "Keller: Looks like a patrol. They should move on soon."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg04_08"
msgstr "Keller: The command post with the maps, it's up there, on the hill."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg05_03"
msgstr "Keller: That was a command tank."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg05_03_01"
msgstr ""
"Keller: If its radio is still intact and tuned to the right frequencies, I "
"could..."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg05_05"
msgstr ""
"Keller: Nein, give patrols false orders. Distract them. So we can slip "
"through."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg06_09a"
msgstr "Keller: Yes, captain Smith."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg06_09b"
msgstr ""
"Keller: Achtung, Panzer Vier! Feindliche Aktivität im Punkt Berta.\n"
"(Attention, Panzer Four! Enemy activity in Sector Berta Point.)"

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg06_09b_01"
msgstr ""
"Keller: Sofort aufklären!\n"
"(Investigate immediately!)"

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg07_01"
msgstr "Keller: This is the command post."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg08_06"
msgstr ""
"Keller: These marks also show command posts. They have fragments of the "
"passage map."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg08_06_01"
msgstr "Keller: For our... German scouts. We should look there."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg09_06"
msgstr "Keller: Here."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg13_03"
msgstr "Keller: Not all officers are responsible for the minefields."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg17_01"
msgstr ""
"Keller: Looks like we've found another command post. We should check it."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg18_02"
msgstr "Keller: Yes, there might be a map fragment too."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg19_03"
msgstr "Keller: No."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg21_06"
msgstr "Keller: They... they didn't notice us."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg25_05"
msgstr "Keller: They've given up searching... for now."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg35_03"
msgstr "Keller: I may be able to draw them off our path."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg36_01"
msgstr "Keller: Going on air."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg36_02"
msgstr ""
"Keller: Achtung! Neue Stellung in Sektor Berta beziehen. Sofort ausführen!\n"
"(Attention! Take new position in Sector Berta. Execute immediately!)"

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg36_04"
msgstr "Keller: Patching through."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg36_05"
msgstr ""
"Keller: Dringender Befehl! Umgruppierung nach Punkt Dora erforderlich!\n"
"(Urgent order! Regrouping to Point Dora required!)"

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg36_07"
msgstr "Keller: Switching to their frequency."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg36_08"
msgstr ""
"Keller: Feindliche Aktivität im Sektor Emil! Sofort untersuchen!\n"
"(Enemy activity in Sector Emil! Investigate immediately!)"

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg36_10"
msgstr "Keller: Broadcasting now."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg36_11"
msgstr ""
"Keller: Zurückziehen auf Stellung Gustav! Schnell! Schnell!\n"
"(Fall back to Position Gustav! Highest priority!)"

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg36_13"
msgstr "Keller: Transmitting."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg36_14"
msgstr ""
"Keller: Gruppe Nord meldet Feindkontakt! Verstärkung benötigt!\n"
"(Battle Group North reports enemy contact! Reinforcement needed!)"

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg37_01"
msgstr "Keller: There's no one on this frequency in range."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg37_02"
msgstr "Keller: No units are responding in this area."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg37_03"
msgstr "Keller: There are no German forces nearby to receive orders."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg37_04"
msgstr ""
"Keller: No response. There's not a single German tank nearby. I think."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg38_01"
msgstr "Keller: Negative."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg38_02"
msgstr "Keller: I can't."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg38_03"
msgstr "Keller: Won't work."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg39_01"
msgstr ""
"Keller: It's the platoon commander's tank, he won't take orders from us."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg39_02"
msgstr "Keller: Platoon commander... He won't take orders from us."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg39_03"
msgstr ""
"Keller: The platoon commander’s tank. They only take orders from Battalion "
"Headquarters."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg40_01"
msgstr "Keller: They're dug in here. It's pointless to order them anything."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg40_02"
msgstr "Keller: This tank is damaged. They use it as a firing post."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg40_03"
msgstr "Keller: It's a damaged tank. They can't move."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg40_04"
msgstr "Keller: Their tracks are broken. They'll stay anyway."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg41_01"
msgstr "Keller: Achtung! They are returning to position."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg41_02"
msgstr "Keller: They're coming back. Be cautious."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg41_03"
msgstr "Keller: Beware! They're turning around."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg42_04"
msgstr "Keller: Perhaps we should... um... head to the command post?"

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg42_04_01"
msgstr "Keller: Before the patrols change?"

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg46_03"
msgstr "Keller: Let me try to distract them."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg47_03"
msgstr "Keller: This is a patrol. They should move soon."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg48_04"
msgstr "Keller: We got lucky. Fate itself wants us to complete the mission."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg49_01"
msgstr ""
"Keller: Captain, they're reporting a rogue American tank on the radio."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg49_01_01"
msgstr "Keller: They'll be looking for us now."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg49_02"
msgstr "Keller: I'm hearing orders to... to send reinforcements."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg49_02_01"
msgstr "Keller: Special unit is hunting for us now..."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg51_01"
msgstr "Keller: This is a patrol. If we time it right, we can slip through."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg51_02"
msgstr ""
"Keller: The patrols follow strict routes. We can slip through when they "
"leave."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg51_03"
msgstr "Keller: A patrol. They'll leave this position soon."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg52_01"
msgstr ""
"Keller: These tanks can't move anymore, but they're using them as fixed "
"positions..."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg52_02"
msgstr ""
"Keller: The garrison is running low on spare parts but they'll still use "
"these tanks as bunkers."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg52_03"
msgstr "Keller: The fuel shortage means these are just... just pillboxes now."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg52_03_01"
msgstr "Keller: But their guns are still dangerous..."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg53_04"
msgstr "Keller: Captain... Panzer! Right there!"

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg56_03"
msgstr "Keller: Perhaps... perhaps we should slow down?"

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg70_04"
msgstr "Keller: Yes, sir."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg74_03"
msgstr "Keller: But the Leaning Tower of Pisa is in... Pisa..."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg80_02"
msgstr ""
"Keller: This radio is for communication. We use it to distract patrols."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg80_02_01"
msgstr "Keller: I wouldn't want to..."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg80_04"
msgstr "Keller: I could try. But it would be German music."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg86_02"
msgstr "Keller: Actually, it's over 1,000."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg86_04"
msgstr "Keller: I have. Hard on the outside, soft inside."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg88_02"
msgstr ""
"Keller: Well... actually... two crews were discussing a ghost haunting the "
"town at night."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg88_05"
msgstr "Keller: No... I never thought I'd be in any tank..."

msgid "vo_sm_char14_m06_stg89_02"
msgstr "Keller: Actually, I'm terrified. I'm just too scared to show it."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_outro_10"
msgstr "Kowalski: Nigdy więcej."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg02_05"
msgstr ""
"Gunner, Sgt. Kowalski: Why did we bring this Kraut along? He'll lead us "
"straight into a trap."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg04_05"
msgstr ""
"Kowalski: Oh sure, trust the word of the German who led us into this trap of"
" a town."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg05_04"
msgstr "Kowalski: Call all Germans here?"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg06_02"
msgstr ""
"Kowalski: The Chaffee's not exactly built for that fight. Though... if "
"Murphy..."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg06_07"
msgstr "Kowalski: Well, go on then, say something to them already."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg06_08"
msgstr "Kowalski: Did you forget how to speak German, Keller?"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg06_08_01"
msgstr "Kowalski: Tell that Tiger to get the hell out of here!"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg13_02"
msgstr "Kowalski: What? I thought every post had a map fragment. Keller?"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg14_03"
msgstr "Kowalski: Well, at least we added a couple more Panzers to our score."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg14_04"
msgstr "Kowalski: Well, at least we added a couple more Panzers to our score."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg14_04_01"
msgstr "Kowalski: And found some fancy new command posts too."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg17_02"
msgstr "Kowalski: What if it's a..."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg21_07"
msgstr "Kowalski: Blind idiots."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg21_08"
msgstr "Kowalski: Ha! How did they miss us?"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg24_05"
msgstr "Kowalski: Let's go before more Krauts show up."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg25_04"
msgstr "Kowalski: Blind idiots. They won't get another chance."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg26_08"
msgstr "Kowalski: Finally! Time for some action!"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg27_05"
msgstr "Kowalski: Clear. Who's next?"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg28_05"
msgstr "Kowalski: Got you!"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg29_03"
msgstr "Kowalski: Not so mighty now, are you? But we lost a lot of time."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg30_03"
msgstr "Kowalski: Let's not rush in blind. What do you think?"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg30_03_01"
msgstr "Kowalski: Maybe Dubois can scout around?"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg31_10"
msgstr "Kowalski: No."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg42_05"
msgstr ""
"Kowalski: Stop wasting time! This map is our ticket through the minefield."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg43_05"
msgstr "Kowalski: Move or I'll start pushing this tank myself!"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg44_03"
msgstr "Kowalski: They're asking for it. Let's show them gdzie raki zimują!"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg45_03"
msgstr "Kowalski: Ok, this time let's not go straight into their guns."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg48_05"
msgstr "Kowalski: Okay, warm-up is over. Now we work for real."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg53_05"
msgstr "Kowalski: Look what we have here!"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg54_03"
msgstr "Kowalski: Our guns will start firing any moment now. Hurry!"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg55_02"
msgstr "Kowalski: Incoming! They've spotted us!"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg60_04"
msgstr "Kowalski: Tiger's aiming! If we don't shake him now, we're finished!"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg60_05"
msgstr "Kowalski: Tiger's about to fire... I know that aim!"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg61_03"
msgstr "Kowalski: Kurde! If it were me, I wouldn't have missed."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg62_03"
msgstr "Kowalski: That all you got, Tiger?"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg64_03"
msgstr "Kowalski: Świetnie! Right where I wanted it!"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg66_03"
msgstr "Kowalski: Look what we have here! Easy targets!"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg67_03"
msgstr "Kowalski: Useless. Might as well throw rocks at it!"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg68_04"
msgstr "Kowalski: Murphy, did you forget? There are mines all around here!"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg69_02"
msgstr "Kowalski: Dostał!"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg71_03"
msgstr "Kowalski: The slaughter begins. We were too slow..."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg77_02"
msgstr "Kowalski: Only at weddings."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg77_04"
msgstr "Kowalski: Is that a proposal, Murphy?"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg78_01"
msgstr "Kowalski: Murphy, let's talk about your driving style."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg78_03"
msgstr ""
"Kowalski: Do you deliberately hit every bump and drive on slopes to make the"
" tank tilt?"

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg78_05"
msgstr "Kowalski: Your allies too."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg79_02"
msgstr "Kowalski: Sometimes I worry about you, Murphy."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg79_04"
msgstr "Kowalski: Seriously. I really worry about you."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg85_02"
msgstr "Kowalski: Not anymore."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg85_04"
msgstr "Kowalski: I doubt it."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg89_01"
msgstr ""
"Kowalski: For a schoolteacher in a tank, you're strangely calm, Keller."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg89_03"
msgstr "Kowalski: Huh. That's... surprisingly honest."

msgid "vo_sm_char15_m06_stg90_01"
msgstr "Kowalski: Dubois, what are you humming over there?"

msgid "vo_sm_char16_m06_stg06_10"
msgstr ""
"Jawohl, verstanden! Bewegen uns zum Punkt Berta!\n"
"(Yes sir, understood! Moving to Berta Point!)"

msgid "vo_sm_char16_m06_stg36_03"
msgstr ""
"Verstanden, bewegen uns nach Berta.\n"
"(Understood, moving to Berta.)"

msgid "vo_sm_char16_m06_stg36_06"
msgstr ""
"Jawohl, beginnen Umgruppierung.\n"
"(Yes sir, beginning regrouping.)"

msgid "vo_sm_char16_m06_stg36_09"
msgstr ""
"Zu Befehl, starten Aufklärung.\n"
"(Yes sir, starting reconnaissance.)"

msgid "vo_sm_char16_m06_stg36_12"
msgstr ""
"Verstanden, ziehen uns zurück.\n"
"(Understood, falling back.)"

msgid "vo_sm_char16_m06_stg36_15"
msgstr ""
"Bestätigt, sind unterwegs.\n"
"(Confirmed, en route.)"

msgid "vo_sm_dday_intro"
msgstr "Ich habe eine Stunde lang mit diesem Karpfen gerungen!"

msgid "vo_sm_dday_intro_01"
msgstr "Hab ihn fast rausgeholt."

msgid "vo_sm_dday_intro_02"
msgstr "Er wog zwanzig Kilo."

msgid "vo_sm_dday_intro_03"
msgstr "Scheiße!"

msgid "vo_sm_dday_intro_04"
msgstr "Was? Du glaubst mir nicht?"

msgid "vo_sm_dday_intro_05"
msgstr "Scheiße!! ALARM!"

msgid "vo_sm_dday_intro_06"
msgstr "Panzer! Panzer!"

msgid "vo_sm_vday_intro_01"
msgstr ""
"Achtung! Achtung!\n"
"(Attention! Attention!)"

msgid "vo_sm_vday_intro_01_01"
msgstr ""
"Wir wenden uns an alle Soldaten und Offiziere der Wehrmacht, Luftwaffe und Kriegsmarine!\n"
"(We are addressing all soldiers and officers of the Wehrmacht, Luftwaffe and Kriegsmarine!)"

msgid "vo_sm_vday_intro_01_02"
msgstr ""
"Das deutsche Oberkommando, hat die bedingungslose Kapitulation unterzeichnet.\n"
"(The German High Command, has signed the unconditional surrender.)"

msgid "vo_sm_vday_intro_01_03"
msgstr ""
"Der Krieg ist vorbei...\n"
"(The war is over...)"

msgid "vo_sm_vday_intro_02"
msgstr ""
"Wir rufen alle auf, die noch sinnlosen Widerstand leisten;\n"
"(We call on all those who are still offering useless resistance;)"

msgid "vo_sm_vday_intro_02_01"
msgstr ""
"Ihre Waffen niederzulegen und sich den alliierten Truppen zu ergeben.\n"
"(To lay down their arms and surrender to the Allied troops.)"

msgid "vo_sm_vday_intro_03"
msgstr ""
"Ihr Leben wird für den Aufbau eines neuen, erneuerten Deutschlands benötigt werden...\n"
"(Your lives will be needed to build a new, renewed Germany...)"

msgid "vo_sm_vday_intro_04"
msgstr ""
"Das ist bloß ein Trick!\n"
"(This is just another Trick.)"

msgid "vo_sm_vday_intro_04_01"
msgstr ""
"Wir kämpfen weiter, bis wir vom Kommando einen Befehl erhalten!\n"
"(Until we get an order from command, we're going to fight.)"
